      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `scmRepositories` resource represents Git repositories Xcode Cloud can access. Use it to retrieve all repositories for a source code management provider you connected to Xcode Cloud and read:",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Note**\n>\n>  This resource supports JSON web tokens with a lifetime of up to six months. For more information, see `generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The name and owner of the repository",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The date when Xcode Cloud last accessed the repository",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "The HTTP and SSH URLs for cloning the repository",
